    "title": "Wall impresses in Holmdel's victory over Middletown North - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Becker ,\n35 minutes ago Charlotte Wall recorded 13 saves in Holmdel’s 3-1 victory over Middletown North in Holmdel. Holmdel led 2-1 after three quarters before adding an insurance goal in the fourth. Avery Granata, Teagan Flaherty and Ryann Buchan each scored a goal for Holmdel (7-6). Evelyn Sarin scored the lone goal for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
